data: {"type": "step", "phase": "end", "node": "prepare_candidates", "thought": "The question asks for the count of tracks per media type. MediaType provides the grouping/labeling (Name) and Track provides the tracks to count (joined via MediaTypeId). PlaylistTrack and InvoiceLine are unrelated to grouping tracks by media type and would only change row counts if joined.", "label": "Preparing candidates"}

