data: {"type": "step", "phase": "end", "node": "construct_sql_from_candidates", "thought": "The question asks for the count of tracks per media type. I'll join MediaType to Track on MediaTypeId and group by media type name. I'll use a LEFT JOIN so media types with zero tracks are included with a count of 0, because the question says \"each media type\" which implies all media types should appear. I'll count TrackId (non-nullable) so zero-row media types yield 0. No time window, ties, or division concerns apply.", "label": "Constructing SQL"}

